WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:04.537
The next morning Ally and Mateo met Tina near the copy shop.

2
00:00:04.538 --> 00:00:05.908
Tina looked worried.

3
00:00:05.909 --> 00:00:12.732
"Are you sure you two want to do this? I can confront the Jorgandian by myself."

4
00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:17.559
Ally took a deep breath. "I want to see it get captured."

5
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.436
"Me too," Mateo said.

6
00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:25.562
"But, Tina, what exactly are you going to do to it?"

7
00:00:25.563 --> 00:00:28.735
Tina showed them a device strapped to her hip.

8
00:00:28.736 --> 00:00:34.422
"This device emits a beam that extracts a Jorgandian from its human body.

9
00:00:34.423 --> 00:00:41.730
Then it traps the life-form so I can transport it to the Astralian Court of Justice."

10
00:00:41.731 --> 00:00:45.437
"But what about the real Eli?" Mateo asked.

11
00:00:45.438 --> 00:00:48.239
"He'll be unharmed and have his body back.

12
00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.452
The extraction process is very simple and safe."

13
00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:58.966
Ally bit her lip. "Remind me again. What am I supposed to do?"

14
00:00:58.967 --> 00:01:05.739
"Get the Jorgandian to confess everything—its reason for following me to Earth and its plan to evaporate us.

15
00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:10.566
The Court of Justice will need this proof in order to press charges."

16
00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:13.395
Tina handed Ally a copy shop bag.

17
00:01:13.396 --> 00:01:19.064
"There's a small computer chip in this bag. It will record everything that happens."

18
00:01:19.065 --> 00:01:27.793
Ally gulped. "Here I go!" Her

19
