64
00:05:11.086 --> 00:05:15.580
That night Ally lay in bed, unable to sleep.

65
00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:21.179
"In a couple of days, Alpha, I'm going to be back in my bed on Astralia."

66
00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:27.300
