67
00:05:27.301 --> 00:05:32.245
"I'm excited but sad too." Ally sighed.

68
00:05:32.246 --> 00:05:36.539
"How do I tell everyone that I'm leaving the planet forever?"

69
00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:41.155
"I suggest telling them that you are going to visit your family," Alpha said.

70
00:05:41.156 --> 00:05:45.639
